4.3 Make the change
Open src/main/resources/templates/fragments/footer.html. It is a Thymeleaf fragment: a piece of HTML that every page includes with th:replace="~{fragments/footer :: footer}". Change it once, and every page changes.
Inside the &lt;footer&gt;, look for the team list.
If there is no list yet, you are first. Add this block just after the build-info line, with your own name and the vertical you will own:
    &lt;!-- TEAM: add your name as a new &lt;li&gt; at the end of this list --&gt;
    &lt;ul class="team-list"&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;Aoife Byrne, Employer vertical&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ul&gt;
If the list is there, add one line for yourself at the end of it, below everyone else:
        &lt;li&gt;Ciarán Walsh, Student vertical&lt;/li&gt;
Keep the indentation the same as the lines around it, and change nothing else in the file.
Run it. Start db if it is not running (step 1.4), run the app (step 1.5), and check that your name appears in the footer of both pages:

http://localhost:8080/MainGallery/HomePage
http://localhost:8080/MainGallery/Login

Then, with db still running, run the build CI will run:
./mvnw verify
